<title>CHINA: China minority regions list 46 companies.</title>
<headline>China minority regions list 46 companies.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A total of 46 companies based in China's minority regions have so far listed shares on the Shanghai and Shenzhen stock exchanges, the Shanghai Securities News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They include companies headquartered in Tibet, Inner Mongolia and Xinjiang, the newspaper said.</p>
